    {"id": 1, "type": "text", "title": "About this dashboard", "transparent": true, "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0}, "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "# Metrics service reachability\nThis dashboard shows whether the local metrics service can reach the active data required by the product. A value below one means access is degraded or unavailable, commonly because a Druid historical node or related Druid service is unhealthy. Review Druid status, historical capacity, and service logs when the signal stays below one. Absence of this metric is intentionally not a service alert; use the Prometheus availability alert for global scrape failures."}},
